==Battleground==
*20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Elizabeth the LVIth]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage so long as you've collected the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] from [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1, as well as one from Chapter 2. Hold back the Gory with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]], upgrade your wallet, then start spamming [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] alongside [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. The Aliens don't stand a chance against Macho Leg Cat's impressive effective stats.

